# The 2003 source material lives in ../NonECG-Paper and stays there. It contains patient
# names and hospital identifiers in YamamotoPaper.txt, and its figures, phantom data and
# software belong to fourteen co-authors and two companies. Nothing from it is used here.
# These patterns are a second line only -- that directory is outside this repository.
NonECG-Paper/
YamamotoPaper.txt
*.STA
*.kyp

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.py.backup

# Downloaded imaging. Never committed: the protocol says no imaging is redistributed, and
# series are identified by UID in results/pilot_series.json so the pilot can be repeated
# from the archive rather than from here.
data_cache/
*.dcm
analysis/tcia_search/probe_cache/
paper/build/preview_*.png
paper/build/*.staged.pdf
